  "notes": [
    "Original authoritative art metadata SHA256 50173b1b192cd29f1cd63ce706e6b5a351d25937891c199e811005cd8458d064",
    "Anatomical anchors supplied by art worker, approximate \u00b12px. Segment ranges derive from source lengths with \u00b14px tolerance for two uncertain endpoints; not validated anatomical limits.",
    "Hand/grip masks are explicit 5x5 opaque pixel patches around manual landmarks, not machine-recognized parts or independent ownership evidence.",
    "Root offsets deliberately omitted because game root motion is unverified. Local stance contact is checked; charge frames excluded.",
    "Source head mask protects selected exact opaque pixels and top/front transparent border only; neck/shoulder remains editable.",
    "Combined shoe contact mask derives from opaque pixels inside the original fixed shoe domain. Its bottommost row measures near-foot contact; exact shoe RGBA lock separately covers both feet."
